cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "NyaRNAthoDEG"
abstract: >
  NyaRNAthoDEG is an end-to-end RNA-seq pipeline covering read QC (FastQC,
  fastp), splice-aware alignment (STAR), gene counting (HTSeq), differential
  expression analysis (DESeq2), and GO enrichment (topGO with Homology-based
  and FANTASIA annotations). Named after Nyarlathotep — the Crawling Chaos —
  plus RNA and DEG (differentially expressed genes).
